# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dashboard configuration is now consolidated into the repo-root MASTER .env.
# There is ONE place to configure everything:
#
#     cp ../.env.example ../.env      # then edit the repo-root .env
#
# The backend and the Vite frontend both read that master automatically (its
# "Dashboard" section: PORT, DATA_SOURCE, EXECUTION_MODE, CORS_ORIGIN,
# INGEST_FEED_URL, optional RPC_URL_*, and VITE_* for the UI).
#
# You may still drop a local `.env` HERE for standalone dashboard work — it
# OVERRIDES the master; real environment variables (incl. the ones the launcher
# injects) override both. Everything has safe defaults; the app runs with ZERO
# configuration in simulation mode.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
